     1397   c-rvs-doc.system-qnty                 at row 4 col 85.5                          colon-aligned view-as text
     1398   c-rvs-doc.wrkr                        at row 5 col 4.5  colon-aligned format "999999999"  view-as fill-in size 10 by 1
     1399   wrkr-name                         at row 5 col 15   colon-aligned no-label fgcolor 4
     1400   r-wrkr                            at row 5 col 28   no-label
