     1408   c-rvs-doc.boss                    at row 7 col 4.5   colon-aligned format "999999999"       view-as fill-in size 10 by 1
     1409   boss-name                     at row 7 col 15    colon-aligned no-label                fgcolor 4
     1410   r-boss                        at row 7 col 28    no-label
